        {
          "id": "/page/2/Text/1",
          "block_type": "Text",
          "html": "<p block-type=\"Text\">recurrence is <i>T</i>(<i>n</i>) = <i>T</i>(<i>n</i> <sup>−</sup> 1) + <i>T</i>(<i>n</i> <sup>−</sup> 2) + <i>O</i>(<i>n</i>), which still has the solution <i>T</i>(<i>n</i>) = <i>O</i>(<i>φ</i> <i>n</i> ).</p>",
          "polygon": [
            [
              69.95904118610578,
              71.71051842058209
            ],
            [
              429.3604935665338,
